b.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104585","id":2867884224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6q8HDA","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T21:09:53Z","updated_at":"2025-05-10T13:53:01Z","body":"Nice! I'm really happy to see this!\r\n\r\n~~There is an issue that makes materials look less rough than they should appear.~~\r\n\r\n| Master | This PR |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b65fffc7-53c9-4218-a9b0-2d7b6c12c6aa) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03433411-a5a1-4035-a939-2ce43d968c8a) |\r\n\r\n| SSR | Ground truth (Cycles) |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5385529a-19c6-4d79-83c3-49abb919cbcd) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b254d9d8-70be-48f6-b597-9f484d2a4319) |","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2867884224/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2868896688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104585#issuecomment-2868896688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104585","id":2868896688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6q_-Ow","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-10T14:00:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-10T22:49:55Z","body":"_Apologies for my many substantial edits, in case you've read this comment before._\r\n\r\nI removed my previous concerns, because my assumptions there were incorrect. However, there are definitely a few issues with the approach.\r\n\r\n#### The calculation of `distance_to_hit_point` seems incorrect:\r\nReflections are relative to the viewer, but the mipmap selection is done based on the world position distance between the reflection surface and reflected pixel. This creates an effect of the mip selection being \"glued\" to surfaces. In the following comparison to Cycles we see that reflection roughness is relative to the viewer. I'm not sure if this is just the effect of reducing roughness based on fresnel, or if there's something more complex happening.\r\n\r\n_PR + reflection probe stretching fix:_\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0329b07c-8ae2-49b6-ab5f-d101221b6f7a\r\n\r\n_Cycles:_\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55f092c2-4ae0-40ee-bfd7-bdf0034c633e\r\n\r\n| PR + stretching fix | Cycles |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08b14f50-1b40-4818-9ea5-1d9d60a2af9f) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85a122b7-4eba-466c-8254-5f110abac63f) |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe0f5b13-c975-4ced-aaca-155d0b0531ed) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63d7c99a-b120-4fd4-a334-aef40af0cc48) |\r\n\r\nThe result of not taking in account the viewer distance is too sharp reflections nearby, and too rough reflections when far away.\r\n\r\n#### I'm unsure that we're applying fresnel correctly from refprobes. We seem to have way too strong reflections at perpendicular viewing angles:\r\n\r\n_PR + reflection probe stretching fix:_\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ffb4355-84a6-4961-aa5f-e926237ed7bc)\r\n\r\n_Cycles:_\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8dc6fb16-eb9c-4364-b551-79923a7e86fd)\r\n\r\n#### It also doesn't seem to handle fully rough surfaces entirely correctly:\r\n\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8dbaa3c4-b0f1-4301-8b51-01e79e19889f) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cbc1f07-94b5-4077-a2a0-5f8e1eca4aa9) |\r\n| - | - |\r\n\r\n\r\nI also think it would be worth considering a different sampler if possible, the linear sampling makes pixels in reflections very obvious. I suspect cubic would work/look much much better for reflections, especially with this contact hardening.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2868896688/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3488315360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104585#issuecomment-3488315360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104585","id":3488315360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7P63fg","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-04T23:04:22Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T23:04:22Z","body":"- Superseded by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3488315360/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]